flowchart TB
    subgraph Clients["Client Applications"]
        direction LR
        Desktop["PySide6 Desktop<br/>(Admin + Staff)"]
        Web["React Web App<br/>(Passengers)"]
    end

    subgraph Backend["Backend Layer"]
        direction TB
        FastAPI["FastAPI<br/>(REST API)"]
        Services["Service Layer<br/>(Business Logic)"]
        Schedule["Schedule Generator<br/>(Automated Flight Creation)"]
        ML["ML Subsystem<br/>(No-Show · Recommender · Fare)"]
        Repos["Repository Layer<br/>(Data Access)"]
    end

    subgraph Data["Data Layer"]
        PG[("PostgreSQL<br/>Database")]
        Models[("Trained ML Models<br/>(*.pkl artifacts)")]
    end

    Desktop -->|SQLAlchemy ORM| Services
    Desktop -->|direct import| Schedule
    Desktop -->|direct import| ML
    Web -->|"REST / JWT"| FastAPI
    FastAPI --> Services
    FastAPI --> ML
    Schedule --> ML
    Services --> Repos
    Repos --> PG
    ML -.->|loads| Models
    Desktop -.->|"also via ORM"| PG